    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2120870/extras/6d68bdb362d1dec74469ce602f557219.avif?t=1724952964\" /></div><br><br>*All characters in this game are 18 or older.<br><br>Her &quot;Prayers&quot; were meaningless in the deep dungeon...<br>Seeking the light of day in a dungeon filled with &quot;Nightmares&quot;...<br>Escape the dungeon, or fail and be humiliated!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2120870/extras/29fc592f530c73735e6c4bc0be47d732.avif?t=1724952964\" /></div><br>\u3000<br>*Story<br>&quot;Lize&quot; was an orphan, taken in and raised by the priest at the church.<br>She lived happily as a nun.<br><br>But one day, while she was out in the city, she got taken by someone...<br><br>She awoke in a dark dungeon...<br>She felt &quot;something&quot; around her... She could hear screaming from a distance...<br>Will she be able to escape the dungeon of nightmares?<br><br><br><br>*System<br>Map exploration escape RPG<br><br>Nuns are weak by nature...<br>No combat, no leveling up...<br>*The status screen will be displayed, but there is no combat.<br>Avoid traps, sneak around enemies and escape the dungeon.<br><br>\u3000<br>*Play time<br>About 2-3 hours<br>*Reach an ending to unlock all scenes.<br>**All scenes can be unlocked in less than hour.<br><br><br>*Situation<br>Run into traps or enemies to trigger naughty scenes.<br>Most scenes involve humiliation plays.<br>Nuns are very religious, rarely reaching orgasms...<br>As a result, they are tortured for a very long time...<br><br><br>*Other<br>-Recollection room<br>-No blood or gore",
